c('marginal heading','underlined [Déf?] live','struck Déf.','underlined [Déf?] live','Initial D is densely retraced, but the following e/f and the separate underline remain; a whole-word cancellation is not securely shown. No final point is visible.','margin',kind='deletion state (struck given live or live given struck)',conf='low',mark='yes')
